  "notes": "Fitted to every CARC-framed Moto Guzzi (Breva 850/1100/1200, Griso, Norge, 1200 Sport, Stelvio). Parameter scalings below were decoded from a live K-Line capture of an IAW 5AM HW610 on a Moto Guzzi. 38 of the 79 answerable identifiers are served from shared zero slots and are marked dead. PF1C and PF2C throttle bodies support the electronic TPS reset; PF3C does not and must be set manually with a voltmeter. Established from the published GuzziDiag/IAWDiag changelogs (see docs/PRIOR_ART.md §8), not from a capture: Fast initialisation only. The service interval is reset from the dashboard, not over diagnostics, and the stepper test needs the engine running.",
